            "detailed_description": "<h1>Checkout Nerdook's latest game</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>A dungeon crawl where YOU are the monsters! Lead your minions in tactical turn-based combat against the pesky heroes, and unlock a variety of evil Powers. With a dynamic campaign system and a branching storyline, &quot;Reverse Crawl&quot; lets you experience an RPG from a whole new angle!<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br>- Tactical turn-based combat system, where you control the dungeon's minions!<br>- A dynamic campaign that will be different each time, complete with a branching storyline<br>- Artwork, coding and animation by one person (!) in that unique Nerdook style <br>- Unlock new minions, traits and powers as you play, depending on your choices during the campaign!",
            "about_the_game": "A dungeon crawl where YOU are the monsters! Lead your minions in tactical turn-based combat against the pesky heroes, and unlock a variety of evil Powers. With a dynamic campaign system and a branching storyline, &quot;Reverse Crawl&quot; lets you experience an RPG from a whole new angle!<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br>- Tactical turn-based combat system, where you control the dungeon's minions!<br>- A dynamic campaign that will be different each time, complete with a branching storyline<br>- Artwork, coding and animation by one person (!) in that unique Nerdook style <br>- Unlock new minions, traits and powers as you play, depending on your choices during the campaign!",
            "short_description": "A dungeon crawl where YOU are the dungeon! Lead your minions in tactical turn-based combat against the pesky heroes, and unlock a variety of evil Powers. With a dynamic campaign system and a branching storyline, &quot;Reverse Crawl&quot; lets you experience an RPG from a whole new angle!",
